   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route105_EventScript_14F2D2",
   "texts": {
    "Route105_Text_1B8C28": "Whew! I was worried that a kid was\\ndrowning when I saw you.\\pYou seem to be okay, so what do you\\nsay to a battle?$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8C99": "Glub... Glub...$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8CA9": "If you are drowning, the signal is to\\nwave one arm toward the beach.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 2,
   "x": 10,
   "y": 44,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_M",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_WALK_LEFT_AND_RIGHT",
   "range": [
    7,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route105_EventScript_14F2E9",
   "texts": {
    "Route105_Text_1B8CEE": "Swimming the deep blue sea...\\nIt feels the greatest!$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8D23": "I lost...\\nNow I'm feeling blue...$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8D45": "Why is the sea blue?\\pI learned about that at the MUSEUM in\\nSLATEPORT, but I forgot.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 3,
   "x": 26,
   "y": 36,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_F",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_WALK_UP_AND_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    7
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route105_EventScript_14F300",
   "texts": {
    "Route105_Text_1B8D99": "My body feels lighter in the water.\\nIt's as if I've gotten slimmer!$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8DDD": "I'm floating...$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8DED": "Your body weight is reduced to just\\none tenth in the water.\\pThat would make me...\\nWhoops! I'm not telling you my weight!$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 4,
   "x": 19,
   "y": 9,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_SWIMMER_F",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_ROTATE_CLOCKWISE",
   "range": [
    0,
    5
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route105_EventScript_14F317",
   "texts": {
    "Route105_Text_1B8E66": "The blue, blue sky...\\nThe vast sea...\\lIt's so peaceful...$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8EA0": "I lost while I was lounging!$",
    "Route105_Text_1B8EBD": "I want to be told I'm relaxing to be\\nwith. Giggle.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 5,
   "x": 8,
   "y": 73,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_ITEM_BALL",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_LOOK_AROUND",
